{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は握手会がありましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"《13日の金曜日》の服で出ましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましての方、久しぶりに会えた方、いつも来てくれる方、女の子♪\n手をふってくれた方も〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんでもらえてたら嬉しいーなー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはスッゴク楽しかった〜！\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お留守番の方も応援ありがとうございます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、初コメさんや、お久し振りのコメさん、他推しのコメさんもいてくれて嬉しいです♪\nありがとうございます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんいつもコメしてくださる方..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温かいコメントありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみん(高山かずみちゃん)と(生田えりかちゃん)と(川後ひなちゃん)に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやらしい服って言ってもらえた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんに黄色と星はまあやっぽいって言われた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんには抹茶のクッキーもらった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理由は毎回差し入れ大量にもって帰っちゃうから、鞄の中がお菓子だらけになったからくれたらしい......笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちゃんとは握手会終わりに、ごはん食べて、まあや家でDVD見たり..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お互いの顔に落書きしたりして遊んだの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初は綺麗だったけど、最後らへんのお互いの顔はヤバかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもめっちゃ楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑怖いでしょ！？笑まあやの目だよっ！(これは、まだ綺麗に書けたときの顔)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、前回の、皆の手の答えは、\nダブルひなちゃんとアミアミでしたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はエイプリルフール、皆さん嘘はつきましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はイギリスでは、トゥルーエイプリルっていって、真実しか言ったらダメなんだって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからプロポーズする人がおおいんだってさぁー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな知ってた？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0019.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}